      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CELEBRITY CRUISE (2) good effort to finish third two starts ago at Bathurst but didn't measure up at her latest appearance over 1660m at Parkes, beaten 16 metres into tenth after being close to the pace throughout. Has the benefit of a good draw. Meets a similar line up and she can figure in the finish. GOTONEBETTOR (3) was responsible for a very good effort last time over 1980m at Tamworth, finishing second and just a head from the winner. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Tackles a similar assignment and he can take care of this line-up. DANCINGONSTARLIGHT (5) was responsible for a better effort last time out when third over 1740m at Riverina Paceway. Should run a big race. MAJOR RECKONING (1) is in the mix following a fifth at his most recent appearance over 2260m at Bathurst.",
